# MapLibre Style JSON endpoint for marketplace-web.
# Must point to an OSM-compatible style provider (MapTiler, Stadia, Protomaps, self-hosted TileServer GL).
#
# Development & Testing options:
#   - MapTiler: https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/style.json?key=YOUR_MAPTILER_KEY
#   - Stadia Maps: https://tiles.stadiamaps.com/styles/alidade_smooth.json?api_key=YOUR_STADIA_KEY
#   - MapLibre Demotiles (dev/test only): https://demotiles.maplibre.org/style.json
#
# Production requirements:
#   - Self-hosted vector tile server (TileServer GL / Martin / PMTiles) or enterprise provider with production SLA.
#   - OpenStreetMap attribution required: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.
#   - DO NOT use the public tile.openstreetmap.org server as a production tile CDN.
VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=REPLACE_ME_OSM_COMPATIBLE_STYLE_URL
